  "description": "<p>Celebrate love, inclusivity, and self-expression with this Pride Rainbow Doormat. It features vibrant rainbow-inspired artwork and a cheerful aesthetic, adding personality and positivity to your home. This doormat is designed for everyday use, offering a welcoming touch to any space.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a bright and colorful Pride design with inclusive artwork.</li>\n<li>Designed for everyday use with a comfortable surface.</li>\n<li>Vivid and long-lasting print enhances home decor.</li>\n<li>Adds personality and warmth to various indoor or outdoor settings.</li>\n<li>Perfect for creating a cozy and welcoming atmosphere with rainbow decor.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Porch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This decorative floor mat is suitable for front doors, entryways, patios, porches, apartments, dorm rooms, classrooms, and offices. It can be used in both indoor and outdoor spaces to enhance your decor.</p>",
